--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Summary of changes made by COSMAC
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

Phase 0 (this change set):

  * Renamed the import package, distribution, console scripts, environment
    variable prefix, configuration root, logger root, metric prefix and data
    paths from prompt-shield / prompt_shield to COSMAC / cosmac.
  * Gave distinct names to three middleware classes that previously shared
    the single name PromptShieldMiddleware.
  * Changed security-relevant inherited defaults: the self-learning vault,
    feedback-driven threshold tuning and threat-feed synchronisation are now
    off by default, and the signature feed refuses to run unverified.
  * Replaced the hard-coded default canary watermark HMAC secret with a
    per-install generated secret.
  * Removed the default upstream signature-feed and threat-feed URLs.
  * Corrected the allowlist to match a whole input and never to apply to
    retrieved or tool-result content.
  * Made the FastAPI, Flask and Django middleware reject a request body that
    cannot be parsed, instead of passing it through unscanned.
  * Removed configuration keys that no code read, and unified the two
    log-level environment variable names.
  * Added an evaluation command that reports detection rates with 95% Wilson
    confidence intervals.
  * Removed the Dify, n8n and PyPI-alias plugins from the build.

Files modified by COSMAC carry no per-file change markers; the complete set
of modifications is recorded in the git history of this repository from the
`upstream-v0.8.1` tag onward.

